Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.51,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're both okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.72,0:00:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.81,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She showed up out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.48,0:00:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and killed Mannen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She said her name was Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.26,0:00:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine called herself Hyphen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.43,0:00:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me to never come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.97,0:00:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So... how come you didn't tell us anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.14,0:00:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you care now you've cleared it?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.59,0:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because... Because of you, Mannen—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What would have changed?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.39,0:00:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you shielded Mannen?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.76,0:00:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You would never have made it back, Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have been killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.20,0:00:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.81,0:01:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just worried about you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.89,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you contact us?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.48,0:01:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us why.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.06,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.77,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.93,0:01:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd never gotten mixed up in this mess.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.80,0:01:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you choose this?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was chosen for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you call out to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.22,0:01:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get them back for Mannen, no matter what!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.26,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.47,0:02:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave together.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.51,0:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.21,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You can't even crack your Egg like this, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.47,0:02:15.54,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,They'll get you if you don't release Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.18,0:02:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.55,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I won't let Leon out.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.85,0:02:27.09,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,If I do...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.09,0:02:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} imprinted on them as their mothers,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but {\i1}we{\i0} created them.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Acca...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.14,0:02:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.40,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.55,0:02:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.45,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your top priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.80,0:03:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.39,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.09,0:03:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.89,0:04:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Acca! Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.84,0:04:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the term "parallel world"?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only in comic books.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually exist.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.59,0:04:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone makes an important \Nchoice, or when they don't,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.29,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,another {\i1}them{\i0} is created in a different, divergent space-time.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.51,0:05:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but in a different \Nspace-time, the Ai you see there...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.39,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.72,0:05:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize. I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.93,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of our eyes, you were \Nbullied and always on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't talk to Mom or anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.59,0:05:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.09,0:05:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.18,0:05:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting to save my friend Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.17,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.59,0:05:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You made a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have others, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru, Rika, Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.18,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That many?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.59,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Super happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.88,0:06:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are Seeno Evils. They're after you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You will?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.09,0:06:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.76,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.51,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong enough to do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.26,0:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.59,0:06:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.22,0:07:45.19,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.13,0:07:46.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.34,0:07:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.93,0:08:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Koito like?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.47,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's special.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She talked to me, even though I was bullied.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's your precious friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.18,0:08:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.51,0:08:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.26,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.76,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your mom's fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.93,0:09:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,would you help me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.72,0:09:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Art is an explosion!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.55,0:09:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.78,0:09:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.76,0:09:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Compliance is such a pain these days!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.26,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we teachers supposed to blow off steam?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you aiming?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.18,0:10:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens to students \Nwho disobey their teachers.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.93,0:10:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.14,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Mr. Sawaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.03,0:10:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sawaki. I'm your first love.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.79,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.26,0:10:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki is...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a lot nicer!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my public face.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.68,0:10:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,People are easy to fool when you're born handsome.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pest!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.40,0:11:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a monster that my doubts and suspicions created.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.45,0:11:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Mr. Sawaki isn't like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.64,0:11:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like my public face
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.08,0:11:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,has you completely fooled, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.76,0:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.18,0:12:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You changed your hairpin.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.98,0:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it feel gross?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.94,0:12:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.03,0:12:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shoes.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.53,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them off.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.95,0:12:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.12,0:12:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.29,0:12:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you want to trust me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.21,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.17,0:12:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, love is blind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew how you felt.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.76,0:12:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You love me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A pure, unsullied love.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to adult love,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it's far more fragile, ephemeral, and beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Both you and Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.57,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Adult love is dirty.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.74,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's full of self-interest. Doesn't it make you sick?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.83,0:13:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day, you'll end up like that, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.75,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.75,0:13:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you should die before you grow up.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.71,0:13:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.55,0:13:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A world free from care.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A comfortable world.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you be happy there?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll support you no matter what, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You only live once. Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing Kotobuki said.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.46,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.46,0:14:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you regret it, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.89,0:14:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.47,0:14:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You regret it, don't you, Ai?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.35,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.52,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.98,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shout it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.65,0:14:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.69,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.15,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what your mom did?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.43,0:15:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She got dazzled by a man and tried \Nto put her own desires first.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.84,0:15:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so shocked you don't want to admit it,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.47,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but even your mom is a stranger.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.06,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When I stopped going to school, \NMom never blamed me even once.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.52,0:15:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She was always worrying about me where \NI couldn't see, so that I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.28,0:16:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that she'd support me no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.82,0:16:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to support her, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'd feel bad for Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.33,0:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost pitifully innocent, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.09,0:16:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You be happy too, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.22,0:16:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got my full support.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with the me that craved attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.44,0:16:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.28,0:16:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to believe!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.28,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I can't protect anyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't love anyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.83,0:16:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same mouth you asked me out with!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.79,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.93,0:17:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.38,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.02,0:17:12.81,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.02,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.02,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.48,0:17:17.03,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.03,0:17:18.97,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, other me?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.17,0:17:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see her again soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.64,0:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to hear the truth from Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.35,0:17:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I feel grateful.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was a fake friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.86,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saved back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.03,0:18:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.62,0:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a warrior of Eros.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.87,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight Thanatos, the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to go to parallel worlds yet,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.09,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mom is sad.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.68,0:18:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to get strong like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's silly.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.86,0:18:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.03,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.10,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.62,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.41,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirara Rodriguez Matured XVIII Evening Star SS Plum.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirara... Long name.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.81,0:19:16.48,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.15,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Let me in, you bastards!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.27,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll bring my wallet next time!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.02,0:19:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mission is over.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.73,0:19:23.61,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I want to get even for Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With hatred, she'll be taken by Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.45,0:19:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never know unless we try.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.03,0:19:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you care what happens to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.70,0:19:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows the risk.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.25,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't actually care about Frill, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.04,0:19:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.50,0:19:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can save Himari.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.88,0:19:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.47,0:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how we've always been?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.81,0:19:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you. I won't.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.24,0:20:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So shiny.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.13,0:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The other... me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.25,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She... protected me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.27,0:20:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want shiny things.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shiny"?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.58,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.17,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.51,0:21:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.52,0:22:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Comment: 10,0:03:09.92,0:03:09.92,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Comment: 10,0:04:39.93,0:04:39.93,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Comment: 10,0:12:09.04,0:12:09.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Comment: 10,0:21:16.05,0:21:16.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Comment: 10,0:22:46.09,0:22:46.10,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Epilogue}
